<style>.blankets{max-width:1080px}.blankets h1{font-size:28px;line-height:1.2;margin:16px 0}.blankets h2{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 12px}.blankets p{line-height:1.55;margin:12px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.blankets section{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce2ec;border-radius:18px;padding:20px;margin:20px 0}.blankets label{display:block}.blankets .contract-fields{display:grid;gap:14px;max-width:650px}.blankets input:not([type=checkbox]),.blankets textarea,.blankets select{box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;width:100%}.blankets .table-scroll{max-width:100%;max-height:480px;overflow:auto}.blankets td{white-space:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.blankets .btn{white-space:normal;margin:6px 0}.blankets details{margin:16px 0}.blankets form{margin:14px 0}@media(max-width:600px){.blankets section{padding:16px}.blankets h1{font-size:25px}}</style>
<div class="blankets">
<p><a data-blanket-back href="<%= screen.allowed?'/autopilot/reviews/blanket-releases':'/autopilot' %>">← <%= screen.allowed?'Supplier contract review':'StockChief AI' %></a></p>
<h1>Supplier contracts &amp; scheduled releases</h1>
<p>Record the agreed products, prices, total units or value and release dates once. On each release date StockChief makes the release a real purchase order, adjusted to demand within the range you agreed, and tracks what is left. It never goes over the contract’s totals or past its dates.</p>
<p>Pro drafts each release for your approval until you approve one and teach it. Then, like Custom without training, it places releases and emails the supplier on its own within your purchasing limits. You can undo a release before its email goes out. Receiving and payment stay separate. No AI credits are used.</p>
<% if(!screen.allowed){ %><section data-agent-plan-locked><h2>Pro or Custom required</h2><p>Starter and Growth cannot prepare contract releases or enable these routines. Historical agreements and linked orders are preserved; you can still stop an existing routine or end an unprepared schedule.</p><a class="btn" href="/billing">Upgrade</a></section><% } %>
<% if(screen.shadow){ %><p class="notice">The first 14 days are for watching. Preview the schedule now; writing starts after that period and your authority settings allow it.</p><% } %>
<% if(screen.selected){ const p=screen.selected; %>
<section><h2><%= p.reference %></h2><p><%= p.source_snapshot.supplier.name %> · <%= p.source_snapshot.place.name %> · Agreement goods value <strong><%= cash.format(Number(p.goods_value_minor),p.currency) %></strong></p>
<p><%= p.stopped?'Remaining schedule ended':p.enabled?'The release schedule is running':'Releases are prepared when you ask' %>. Agreement prices stay fixed. A changed or cancelled linked order holds further releases for review.</p>
<% if(screen.problem){ %><p role="status" class="notice"><%= screen.problem %></p><% } %>
<% if(p.flex_percent>0){ %><p>Each release may move with demand by up to <%= p.flex_percent %>%.</p><% } %>
<% if(screen.value){ %><p>Called off so far: <strong><%= cash.format(screen.value.drawnMinor,p.currency) %></strong><% if(screen.value.limitMinor!=null){ %> of the <%= cash.format(screen.value.limitMinor,p.currency) %> contract value · <strong><%= cash.format(Math.max(0,screen.value.leftMinor),p.currency) %> left</strong><% } %>.</p><% } %>
<h3>Contract quantity check</h3><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Product code</th><th>Agreement units</th><th>In current linked POs</th><th>Remaining against POs</th><th>Still scheduled</th><th>Skipped</th></tr></thead><tbody><% screen.drawdown.forEach(function(l){ %><tr><td><%= l.sku %></td><td><%= l.totalUnits %></td><td><%= l.currentUnits %></td><td><%= l.remainingUnits %></td><td><%= l.plannedUnits %></td><td><%= l.skippedUnits %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div>
<p>Linked PO units include unapproved drafts and exclude cancelled orders. A changed linked PO can make the saved schedule exceed the remaining agreement; StockChief holds further drafts instead of silently changing the agreement.</p>
<% if(p.enabled){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/blanket-releases/<%= p.id %>/settings"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= p.revision %>"><input type="hidden" name="stop" value="yes"><button class="btn">Stop the release schedule</button></form><% } %>
<% if(screen.allowed&&!p.enabled&&!p.stopped){ %>
<form method="post" action="/autopilot/blanket-releases/<%= p.id %>/settings"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= p.revision %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> Run this agreement’s release schedule. <%= screen.plan==='pro'&&!screen.trainingReady?'Until you teach it, each release waits for your approval.':'Releases are placed within your purchasing limits; anything else waits for you.' %></label><button class="btn" <%= screen.problem?'disabled':'' %>>Run the release schedule</button><% if(screen.plan==='pro'&&!p.trained_release_id){ %><p>To let it place releases on its own, approve one release’s purchase order below, then choose it as your teaching example.</p><% } %></form><% } %>
<details data-blanket-dates><summary>Review all <%= screen.slots.length %> release dates</summary>
<% screen.slots.forEach(function(r){ var notes=(r.adjustment&&r.adjustment.notes)||[]; %><article data-blanket-release="<%= r.id %>"><h3><%= r.release_date %> · <%= r.status==='DRAFTED'?(r.sent_at?'Ordered and queued to the supplier':'Purchase draft prepared'):r.status==='SKIPPED'?'Skipped':r.undone_at?'Undone, waiting for you':'Scheduled' %></h3><p>Delivery estimate: <%= r.expected_date %> · <%= r.status==='SKIPPED'?'Not ordered, scheduled':'Goods' %> <%= cash.format(Number(r.goods_value_minor),p.currency) %></p><ul><% r.lines.forEach(function(l){ var n=notes.find(function(x){return x.skuId===l.skuId}); %><li><%= l.sku %> · <%= l.quantityUnits %> units at <%= cash.format(l.unitCostMinor,p.currency) %><% if(n&&n.scheduledUnits!==n.quantityUnits){ %> (scheduled <%= n.scheduledUnits %>: <%= n.why.toLowerCase() %>)<% } %></li><% }) %></ul>
<% if(r.adjustment&&r.adjustment.skipped){ %><p><%= r.adjustment.skipped %></p><% } %><% if(r.needs_person&&r.status==='DRAFTED'&&['DRAFT','AWAITING_APPROVAL'].includes(r.order_status)){ %><p class="notice notice--warn"><span>Waiting for your approval: <%= r.needs_person %></span></p><% } %>
<% if(r.automatic&&r.status==='DRAFTED'&&['DRAFT','AWAITING_APPROVAL','APPROVED'].includes(r.order_status)&&(!r.effect_status||r.effect_status==='PENDING')){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/blanket-releases/releases/<%= r.id %>/undo"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> Cancel this release’s PO<%= r.sent_at?' and its queued email':'' %>. Its units go back on the contract.</label><button class="btn">Undo this release</button></form><% } %>
<% if(r.purchase_order_id){ %><p><a href="/purchasing/orders/<%= r.purchase_order_id %>">Open <%= r.po_number %></a> · <%= r.order_status %><% if(r.order_expected_date&&r.order_expected_date!==r.expected_date){ %> · Current PO expected date: <%= r.order_expected_date %><% } %> · <%= r.automatic?'Prepared by the routine':'Individually reviewed release' %></p><% } %>
<% if(screen.allowed&&!p.stopped&&r.status==='PLANNED'){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/blanket-releases/releases/<%= r.id %>/prepare"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I approve preparing this exact release as an unapproved purchase draft now.</label><button class="btn">Prepare this release draft</button></form><% } %>
<% if(screen.allowed&&screen.plan==='pro'&&!p.stopped&&r.status==='DRAFTED'&&!r.sent_at){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/blanket-releases/releases/<%= r.id %>/teach"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> Use this individually reviewed, approved purchase release as the example for matching routine drafts.</label><button class="btn" <%= !['APPROVED','ORDERED','PLACED','PARTIALLY_RECEIVED','RECEIVED'].includes(r.order_status)?'disabled':'' %>>Teach from this approved release</button></form><% } %>
<% if(r.status==='PLANNED'){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/blanket-releases/releases/<%= r.id %>/skip"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> Skip this unprepared date. These units will not be ordered or reassigned automatically.</label><button class="btn">Skip this unprepared release</button></form><% } %></article><% }) %></details>
<% if(!p.stopped){ %><details><summary>End the remaining schedule</summary><form method="post" action="/autopilot/blanket-releases/<%= p.id %>/end"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= p.revision %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> End all remaining unprepared dates. Existing purchase orders, receipts and payments are preserved and are not cancelled.</label><button class="btn btn--danger">End remaining schedule</button></form></details><% } %>
</section><% } %>
<% if(screen.allowed&&!screen.selected){ const value=draft?draft.scope:{supplier_id:'',destination_id:'',reference:'',currency:'USD',first_release:screen.today,last_release:screen.today,interval_days:7,lead_days:0}; %>
<section><h2>Review a supplier agreement</h2><p>Use one active supplier, receiving warehouse and currency; up to 100 whole-unit products and 52 releases within a year. Quantities must fit current supplier packs and minimums. Enter only terms you checked against the agreement.</p>
<form class="contract-fields" method="post" action="/autopilot/blanket-releases/preview"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
<label>Supplier<select name="supplierId" aria-label="Supplier" required><% screen.suppliers.forEach(function(s){ %><option value="<%= s.id %>" <%= value.supplier_id===s.id?'selected':'' %>><%= s.name %> · <%= s.currency %></option><% }) %></select></label>
<label>Receiving location<select name="destinationId" aria-label="Receiving location" required><% screen.places.forEach(function(l){ %><option value="<%= l.id %>" <%= value.destination_id===l.id?'selected':'' %>><%= l.name %></option><% }) %></select></label>
<label>Supplier contract reference<input name="reference" required maxlength="100" value="<%= value.reference %>"></label>
<label>Agreed currency<input name="currency" required maxlength="3" value="<%= value.currency %>"></label>
<label>First release date<input type="date" name="firstRelease" required value="<%= value.first_release %>"></label>
<label>Last possible release date<input type="date" name="lastRelease" required value="<%= value.last_release %>"></label>
<label>Days between releases<input type="number" min="1" max="365" name="intervalDays" required value="<%= value.interval_days %>"></label>
<label>Expected delivery lead time, days<input type="number" min="0" max="365" name="leadDays" required value="<%= value.lead_days %>"></label>
<label>Contract total value (optional)<input name="valueLimit" inputmode="decimal" value="<%= value.value_limit_minor?cash.fromMinor(value.value_limit_minor,value.currency):'' %>"></label>
<label>Each release may move with demand by up to (%)<input type="number" min="0" max="100" name="flexPercent" value="<%= value.flex_percent||0 %>"></label>
<p>With 0%, every release is exactly as scheduled. Above 0%, StockChief orders what your stock targets need, within that range, in whole supplier packs.</p>
<label>Agreed product rows<textarea name="linesText" rows="7" required placeholder="SKU,total_units,release_units,unit_price&#10;ITEM-001,100,20,1.00"><%= draft?['SKU,total_units,release_units,unit_price',...draft.scope.line_terms.map(function(l){return [l.sku,l.totalUnits,l.releaseUnits,cash.fromMinor(l.unitCostMinor,draft.scope.currency)].map(function(v){return '\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"'}).join(',')})].join('\n'):'' %></textarea></label>
<p>Paste a CSV or tab-separated table with these exact headers: SKU, total_units, release_units, unit_price. Prices are per stock unit; releases must fit the recorded supplier pack.</p><button class="btn btn--primary">Preview contract release schedule</button></form>
<% if(screen.moreSuppliers||screen.morePlaces){ %><p>The selection lists show the first 250 active suppliers and internal locations.</p><% } %></section>
<% if(draft){ %><section><h2>Review the exact release schedule</h2><p><%= draft.source.supplier.name %> · <%= draft.source.place.name %> · <%= draft.schedule.length %> releases · Goods <%= cash.format(draft.goodsValueMinor,draft.scope.currency) %><% if(draft.scope.value_limit_minor){ %> · Contract value <%= cash.format(draft.scope.value_limit_minor,draft.scope.currency) %><% } %><% if(draft.scope.flex_percent){ %> · Releases move with demand by up to <%= draft.scope.flex_percent %>%<% } %></p>
<div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Release date</th><th>Expected delivery</th><th>Units</th><th>Goods value</th></tr></thead><tbody><% draft.schedule.forEach(function(r){ %><tr><td><%= r.releaseDate %></td><td><%= r.expectedDate %></td><td><%= r.lines.map(function(l){return l.sku+': '+l.quantityUnits}).join('; ') %></td><td><%= cash.format(r.goodsValueMinor,draft.scope.currency) %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div>
<form method="post" action="/autopilot/blanket-releases"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="sourceHash" value="<%= draft.sourceHash %>">
<% for(const field of [['supplierId','supplier_id'],['destinationId','destination_id'],['reference','reference'],['currency','currency'],['firstRelease','first_release'],['lastRelease','last_release'],['intervalDays','interval_days'],['leadDays','lead_days'],['flexPercent','flex_percent']]){ %><input type="hidden" name="<%= field[0] %>" value="<%= draft.scope[field[1]] %>"><% } %><input type="hidden" name="valueLimit" value="<%= draft.scope.value_limit_minor?cash.fromMinor(draft.scope.value_limit_minor,draft.scope.currency):'' %>">
<input type="hidden" name="linesText" value="<%= ['SKU,total_units,release_units,unit_price',...draft.scope.line_terms.map(function(l){return [l.sku,l.totalUnits,l.releaseUnits,cash.fromMinor(l.unitCostMinor,draft.scope.currency)].map(function(v){return '\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"'}).join(',')})].join('\n') %>">
<label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I checked the actual supplier agreement and approve these exact products, prices, total quantities and dates. This saves a private schedule; it does not approve or send a purchase order.</label><button class="btn btn--primary">Save reviewed supplier schedule</button></form></section><% } %><% } %>
<section><h2>Saved supplier contracts</h2><ul><% screen.rows.forEach(function(p){ %><li><a href="/autopilot/blanket-releases/<%= p.id %>"><%= p.reference %></a> · <%= p.supplier_name %> · <%= cash.format(Number(p.goods_value_minor),p.currency) %> · <%= p.stopped?'Schedule ended':p.enabled?'Routine enabled':'Individual releases' %></li><% }) %></ul><% if(screen.page>1){ %><a href="/autopilot/blanket-releases?page=<%= screen.page-1 %>">Previous contracts</a><% } %><% if(screen.more){ %><a href="/autopilot/blanket-releases?page=<%= screen.page+1 %>">Next contracts</a><% } %></section>
</div>
